      "label": "User projected onto the 'girls reaction' visual and textual elements",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual of the distressed girl and the accompanying text 'girls reaction' and 'when teacher says \"get out of class\"', implying that the user identifies with or imagines themselves as the girl experiencing distress in this scenario. This projection is part of the meme's setup to contrast with the 'boys reaction'.",
